":"solid","strokeWidth":2,"version":797,"roundness":{"type":3},"type":"rectangle","updated":1779162132316,"id":"AXrgRQvSkCi6EozzqGNaR","x":3309.4726410459484,"seed":566218089,"boundElements":[{"type":"text","id":"oncij2JSN64r7OcDAPeJy"}],"y":808.67088543132365,"opacity":100,"height":280.7109375,"width":776.83984375,"frameId":null,"strokeStyle":"solid","versionNonce":1716792039},{"seed":1784184071,"strokeStyle":"solid","id":"oncij2JSN64r7OcDAPeJy","strokeWidth":2,"roughness":1,"isDeleted":false,"fontSize":20,"opacity":100,"verticalAlign":"middle","updated":1779162132316,"locked":false,"text":"我每天上班 996，根本没时间盯盘。但身边同事最近都在聊股票，A 股也时不时来一\n波，我心里有点痒——想做点投资，又不想 all in。\n\n问题是，我每天能花在股市上的时间也就是早上 10 分钟、中午 10 分钟、晚上半小\n时。靠这点时间手动看盘根本不够。\n\n\"我会用 AI、会写代码——能不能让 AI帮我盯盘？\n\n我想做一个工具，每天告诉我市场发生了什么、我手里的股票怎么样、有没有什么我该\n立刻注意的事。\"","version":740,"autoResize":true,"type":"text","backgroundColor":"transparent","index":"b1b","roundness":null,"containerId":"AXrgRQvSkCi6EozzqGNaR","originalText":"我每天上班 996，根本没时间盯盘。但身边同事最近都在聊股票，A 股也时不时来一波，我心里有点痒——想做点投资，又不想 all in。\n\n问题是，我每天能花在股市上的时间也就是早上 10 分钟、中午 10 分钟、晚上半小时。靠这点时间手动看盘根本不够。\n\n\"我会用 AI、会写代码——能不能让 AI帮我盯盘？\n\n我想做一个工具，每天告诉我市场发生了什么、我手里的股票怎么样、有没有什么我该立刻注意的事。\"","height":250,"link":null,"strokeColor":"#1e1e1e","fillStyle":"solid","groupIds":["fYRhM_V5aI4aPijBKV152","YiNIQzHaBkPVf4b_vDYPk","spXG9VZOZ38j_AQwsfdaG"],"versionNonce":1887188487,"textAlign":"left","fontFamily":5,"lineHeight":1.25,"frameId":null,"boundElements":[],"x":3314.4726410459484,"angle":0,"y":824.02635418132365,"width":760},{"isDeleted":false,"locked":false,"strokeColor":"#e03131","link":null,"roughness":1,"groupIds":["fYRhM_V5aI4aPijBKV152","YiNIQzHaBkPVf4b_vDYPk","spXG9VZOZ38j_AQwsfdaG"],"index":"b1c","backgroundColor":"#a5d8ff","angle":0,"fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":2,"version":764,"roundness":{"type":3},"type":"rectangle","updated":1779162132316,"id":"j4HK2yx05sLxccdsJXS9g","x":3314.2070160459484,"seed":477763337,"boundElements":[{"type":"text","id":"xcT0wOZrhvXUPsOLOj4Zx"}],"y":