":"middle","updated":1779191798452,"locked":false,"text":"\n写 PRD，你要知道 调研文件中有什么，以及 PRD 的标准格式是什么\n\n所以这里的思考是：设计两个\"接口契约\"：\n  - 接口一：brainstorming 的产物 = PRD 的输入清单\n  - 接口二：PRD 的产物 = Spec-Kit \/specify 的输入清单","version":761,"autoResize":true,"type":"text","backgroundColor":"transparent","index":"bBAV","roundness":null,"containerId":"bclu1tKOKidCiVQSrJ54E","originalText":"\n写 PRD，你要知道 调研文件中有什么，以及 PRD 的标准格式是什么\n\n所以这里的思考是：设计两个\"接口契约\"：\n  - 接口一：brainstorming 的产物 = PRD 的输入清单\n  - 接口二：PRD 的产物 = Spec-Kit \/specify 的输入清单","height":150,"link":null,"strokeColor":"#1e1e1e","fillStyle":"hachure","groupIds":["bZDyNZ87np9lvs6WP9NpW"],"versionNonce":458704775,"textAlign":"left","fontFamily":5,"lineHeight":1.25,"frameId":null,"boundElements":[],"x":3081.6816784985681,"angle":0,"y":6999.3946587098344,"width":620.5599365234375},{"isDeleted":false,"locked":false,"strokeColor":"#1e1e1e","link":null,"roughness":1,"groupIds":["ECVsHWWec0zY8lO5ddep8","bZDyNZ87np9lvs6WP9NpW"],"index":"bBAl","backgroundColor":"transparent","angle":0,"fillStyle":"hachure","strokeWidth":2,"version":666,"roundness":{"type":3},"type":"rectangle","updated":1779191798452,"id":"gcR3sMEb61IY21RtdrEek","x":3070.9294612688836,"seed":1570246503,"boundElements":[{"type":"text","id":"jMb-g-ibxMXZeX1ZAdW01"}],"y":6848.4572847327836,"opacity":100,"height":112.39067262916797,"width":396.16372928648707,"frameId":null,"strokeStyle":"solid","versionNonce":473087655},{"seed":376534825,"strokeStyle":"solid","id":"jMb-g-ibxMXZeX1ZAdW01","strokeWidth":2,"roughness":1,"isDeleted":false,"fontSize":20,"opacity":100,"verticalAlign":"middle","updated":1779191798452,"locked":false,"text":"Step 6\n\n配置 SuperPowers环境","version":401,"autoResize":true,"type":"text","backgroundColor":"transparent","index":"bBB","roundness":null,"containerId":"gcR3sMEb61IY21RtdrEek","originalText":"Step 6\n\n配置 SuperPowers环境","height":75,"link":null,"strokeColor":"#1e1e1e","fillStyle":"hachure","groupIds":["ECVsHWWec0zY8lO5ddep8","bZDyNZ87np9lvs6WP9NpW"],"vers