51300592507,"seed":98221223,"boundElements":[{"type":"text","id":"bCkEJaqOX3j3u6mQZqp0v"}],"y":7187.738903454916,"opacity":100,"height":123.7713744742814,"width":1401.7465650345325,"frameId":null,"strokeStyle":"solid","versionNonce":480466279},{"seed":1995231271,"strokeStyle":"solid","id":"bCkEJaqOX3j3u6mQZqp0v","strokeWidth":2,"roughness":1,"isDeleted":false,"fontSize":20,"opacity":100,"verticalAlign":"middle","updated":1779191798452,"locked":false,"text":"再次之前，要知道：从功能上和产品需求上，其实是可以确定的，因为不涉及具体的技术，  但是， 我这里采用了多个开源的项目，想基于他们做二次开发，\n所以，到底是采用 单一项目，还是多个项目的复合，（可能某一个项目不能支撑完整的功能），在写 PRD或者后续写规划的时候，就要确定前后端的技术架\n构，以及具体某一个功能模块 要采用什么方案，所以需要再次基础上，继续开启 源码的二次调研，并形成文档，在开始 最终的头脑风暴的","version":172,"autoResize":true,"type":"text","backgroundColor":"transparent","index":"bBJ","roundness":null,"containerId":"K3klcNplxuw-JZw3QuyMi","originalText":"再次之前，要知道：从功能上和产品需求上，其实是可以确定的，因为不涉及具体的技术，  但是， 我这里采用了多个开源的项目，想基于他们做二次开发，所以，到底是采用 单一项目，还是多个项目的复合，（可能某一个项目不能支撑完整的功能），在写 PRD或者后续写规划的时候，就要确定前后端的技术架构，以及具体某一个功能模块 要采用什么方案，所以需要再次基础上，继续开启 源码的二次调研，并形成文档，在开始 最终的头脑风暴的","height":75,"link":null,"strokeColor":"#1e1e1e","fillStyle":"hachure","groupIds":[],"versionNonce":411177095,"textAlign":"left","fontFamily":5,"lineHeight":1.25,"frameId":null,"boundElements":[],"x":3076.9151300592507,"angle":0,"y":7212.1245906920567,"width":1384},{"isDeleted":false,"locked":false,"strokeColor":"#e03131","link":null,"roughness":1,"groupIds":["ZKdVk59qnXw3LeveyZsus"],"index":"bBW","backgroundColor":"transparent","angle":0,"fillStyle":"hachure","strokeWidth":2,"version":633,"roundness":{"type":3},"type":"rectangle","updated":1779191798452,"id":"EYUwJaW2httNAXd1HHoi4","x":3504.6223973805072,"seed":1645922537,"boundElements":[{"type":"text","id":"Dj10Mv9SwOGTXqbJs5OMw"}],"y":7510.9622415256272,"opacity":100,"height":135,"width":974.35967368554429,"frameId":null,"strokeStyle":"solid","versionNonce":454846375},{"seed":52500231,"strokeStyle":"solid","id":"Dj10Mv9SwOGTXqbJs5OMw","strokeWidth":2,"roughness":1,"isDeleted":false,"fontSiz